  "cautions": [
    "أَسَاطِيرُ has competing classical analyses as a plural form, including derivation from أُسْطُورَةٌ or other line-related plural formations; the Quranic sense remains tales or legends presented as fabricated or baseless.",
    "مُصَيْطِرٌ is conventionally written with ص in the Quranic form, while the lexical discussion also records س as the original or alternative spelling."
  ],
